Every nebo-video binary embeds an unmodified, prebuilt FFmpeg 8.1.2
(ffmpeg + ffprobe), downloaded by scripts/fetch-ffmpeg.sh and pinned by
sha256:

  Linux, macOS  Martin Riedl's static builds   https://ffmpeg.martin-riedl.de
  Windows       Gyan Doshi's "essentials" build https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds

Both are configured with --enable-gpl and include libx264, so they are
distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later. Corresponding source:

  FFmpeg 8.1.2                https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-8.1.2.tar.xz
  Build scripts and the source of every bundled library are published by
  each builder at the addresses above (Linux/macOS: "Build Information" on
  each release's detail page; Windows: https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/).

Also embedded:

  Inter 4.1   SIL Open Font License 1.1 (assets/Inter-OFL.txt)
              https://rsms.me/inter
